1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,570
A plug approaches its socket, but a disturbance changes the contact just before insertion.
插头靠近插座，扰动却改变了接触状态。

2
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:11,930
TouchWorld separates deciding what to do from rapidly correcting how the hand is doing it.
TouchWorld把任务决策和手部快速纠错分开。

3
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:18,704
Read the architecture from planner to tactile world model, action policy, and refinement policy.
沿架构依次看规划器、触觉世界模型、动作和修正策略。

4
00:00:19,084 --> 00:00:23,204
Each component handles a different part of the problem, at a different time scale.
不同组件在不同时间尺度上解决不同问题。

5
00:00:23,779 --> 00:00:28,679
The planner decomposes a longer instruction into an executable subtask.
规划器把长指令分解为可执行子任务。

6
00:00:28,879 --> 00:00:34,199
The tactile world model predicts the visual and tactile outcome that this subtask should achieve.
触觉世界模型预测子任务应达到的视觉和触觉结果。

7
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:39,910
A goal-conditioned policy reads current observations and these predicted subgoals.
目标条件策略读取当前观测与预测子目标。

8
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,790
It generates an action chunk, providing the arm and hand with a short motion plan.
它生成动作块，为手臂和手提供短期运动计划。

9
00:00:45,318 --> 00:00:50,358
A faster refinement policy reads recent tactile history and the robot state.
更快的修正策略读取近期触觉和机器人状态。

10
00:00:50,698 --> 00:00:56,338
It predicts residual corrections when actual contact drifts, rather than waiting for full replanning.
实际接触偏离时，它给出残差修正。

11
00:00:56,870 --> 00:01:02,770
The paper studies six real tasks, including plug insertion, cup insertion, and tissue pulling.
论文研究插头、插杯、抽纸等六项真机任务。

12
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:10,290
The website also shows accelerated teleoperated collection clips; those are demonstrations, not autonomous results.
官网加速采集片段属于遥操作示教，并非自主结果。

13
00:01:10,814 --> 00:01:17,814
Reported average success is sixty-five percent in clean conditions and fifty-three point seven under perturbation.
正常条件平均65%，扰动条件为53.7%。

14
00:01:18,194 --> 00:01:23,314
FTP-1 reaches forty-nine point three and thirty-five point two under the corresponding settings.
对应FTP-1为49.3%和35.2%。

15
00:01:24,055 --> 00:01:29,295
The paper reports two hundred demonstrations and one hundred evaluations per task.
论文报告每任务200条示教和100次评测。

16
00:01:29,655 --> 00:01:35,995
The allocation across settings and detailed completion rules need clearer disclosure before cross-paper comparisons.
条件分配和完整成功判据仍需进一步明确。

17
00:01:36,705 --> 00:01:43,865
The takeaway is a division of labor: contact prediction guides motion, and contact feedback corrects it.
关键是分工：接触预测引导运动，反馈修正运动。

18
00:01:44,505 --> 00:01:48,105
Component update rates alone do not establish the complete system delay.
组件更新频率本身不能证明系统端到端延迟。
